      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUNSWICK ROCKET (1) is suited by the inside draw. Latest effort finished 5th on October 29 over 457m at Q Lakeside behind Bay Flyer beaten 6 lengths (26.02) in a Mix 5. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. PEAKY WARLOCK (7) improved his time on first attempt here at the trip with a 0.8 lengths second in 30.27 latest. Top run latest and can measure up here. ART OF DECEPTION (2) has shown good speed at her last couple and filled minor placings, last time finishing second beaten 4 lengths (30.32). Hard to beat again. SELECT AIRLEY (6) was well fancied last time on the strength of her recent form but could only manage fourth (30.61) at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to her credit.",
